Shout-Outs
Hi Marius Ionut! Sneha Rao sent Alexandru Simion a Shout-Out and wants you =
to know.
I'd like to give a special shout-out to Alex for going above and beyond! No=
t only did he help me resolve my Outlook archive issues, but they also took =
the time to explain the process, making sure I understood how to handle simi=
lar situations in the future. Their patience and expertise made what could h=
